+         * The equality is checked rather than assumed: the counts are indexed by chunk, so
+         * a mismatch would not merely lose the saving, it would read the wrong slot. The
+         * veto above can only return 0 or the limit, so this holds whenever the buffer is
+         * there - but a future veto that returned a third value would fail closed here
+         * instead of drawing the wrong thing. */
+        bool count_draw = counts_scratch.buffer != VK_NULL_HANDLE &&
+                chunk_blocks == d3d12_dgc_emulate_multi_draw_blocks_limit(list->device);
